---@field SecurityGroupIds? aws.fsx.SecurityGroupIds A list of IDs specifying the security groups to apply to all network interfaces created for file system access. This list isn't returned in later requests to describe the file system.
---@field Tags? aws.fsx.Tags The tags to apply to the file system that's being created. The key value of the Name tag appears in the console as the file system name.
