---@field EfaEnabled? aws.fsx.Flag Specifies whether Elastic Fabric Adapter (EFA) and GPUDirect Storage (GDS) support is enabled for the Amazon FSx for Lustre file system.
---@field ThroughputCapacity? aws.fsx.ThroughputCapacityMbps The throughput of an Amazon FSx for Lustre file system using the Intelligent-Tiering storage class, measured in megabytes per second (MBps).
