---@field EventLogDestination? aws.fsx.GeneralARN The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) for the destination of the FSRM event logs. The destination can be any Amazon CloudWatch Logs log group ARN or Amazon Kinesis Data Firehose delivery stream ARN.

